  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/78f246e7-f16c-4064-b070-0327695076e5-0a278a3c-a09a-4972-8990-ff4088cf7728-9886900.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 206px;\" /></p><p>Applying Newton&#39;s second law along the direction perpendicular to inlined plane:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>)</p><p>(since the acceleration of block in the direction perpendicular to the inclined plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;.....(1)</p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the coefficient of kinetic friction between the block and the inclined plane. Applying Newton&#39;s second law along inclined plane:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; ....(2)</p><p>(since the acceleration along the inclined plane,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(from equation 1 and 2)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
